@@ -198,3 +198,11 @@ This adapter is developed and maintained by [Han Xu](mailto:hanxu8@illinois.edu)
 **Issues and Contributions:**
 - Submit Issues and Pull Requests to the main repository
 - Follow the project's coding style and commit guidelines
+
+Pass `--verifyit` to generate a separate verifier environment using verifyit's
+Script mode. The native LawBench functions and their aggregate metrics are
+retained. Missing answers score zero; incomplete answers cannot trigger the
+complete-reference exact-match shortcut. Empty entity references accept explicit
+empty answers; omitted answers receive no credit. Invalid reference data and scorer
+failures produce unscored verdicts with a minimum reward of zero. Finite negative
+imprisonment scores retain their native metric and receive zero reward.
